        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Natural gas, from low pressure network (&lt;0.1 bar), at service station</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Natural gas, from low pressure network (&lt;0.1 bar), at service station
This data set includes electricity requirements of a service station as well as emissions from losses. The initial pressure of gas is from the low pressure network (&lt;0.1 bar).  VOC emissions are calculated from gas losses and composition of Swiss natural gas.;
UUID: 7fd92306-9ecf-3b08-824b-7092c6caca4e
This data set includes electricity requirements of a natural gas service station as well as emissions from losses.
Location: Data for Switzerland
Technology: Service station with low initial gas pressure (&lt;0.1 bar)
Time period: personal communication
Production volume: na
Sampling: personal communication 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7fd92306-9ecf-3b08-824b-7092c6caca4e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
